{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……爱理感觉怎么样了？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0630", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，谢谢你……好些了……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3066", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——爱理的身体一晚上是恢复不来的。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "——爱理的身体一晚上是恢复不来的。", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，现在考试开始……\\n　请把问题列成一张表」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "「那，现在考试开始……　请把问题列成一张表」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0148", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呜」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3067", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，还是要面对考试。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一点我实在是制止不了她。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理勉勉强强参加了考试。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小爱，这个药对感冒很有效果的。\\n　最好的话还是喝点吧……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「小爱，这个药对感冒很有效果的。　最好的话还是喝点吧……」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0288", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢李……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3068", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用，不用，你今天已经很努力啦。\\n　你要是真的不舒服的话就一定要睡觉哦……」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "「不用，不用，你今天已经很努力啦。　你要是真的不舒服的话就一定要睡觉哦……」", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0289", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，要是不彻底休养的话，感冒是不会好的。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理一直都是萎靡的样子。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你这样子真的没事吗？爱理」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你刚刚的语法题，做得怎么样？」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0229", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……刚刚考的是语法啊……」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3069", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身体一旦出现问题，就什么事都很难办好。\\n脑袋也没法正常运转。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "身体一旦出现问题，就什么事都很难办好。脑袋也没法正常运转。", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，爱理还是考完了全部科目——", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "即便如此，爱理还是考完了全部科目——", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，接下来要收答题纸了」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0149", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3070", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3071", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考完后，爱理精疲力尽地倒下了。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "考完后，爱理精疲力尽地倒下了。", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学，你至少也得多叫点人来帮忙嘛，\\n　爱理同学，钥匙借我用下……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "「新吾同学，你至少也得多叫点人来帮忙嘛，　爱理同学，钥匙借我用下……」", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，爱理，快到了」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0631", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这下终于能让爱理休息了……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和安洁带着爱理，回到她的房间里。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天，樱乃还有天羽学姐，\\n因为担心爱理就都来照顾她了。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "今天，樱乃还有天羽学姐，因为担心爱理就都来照顾她了。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「采购的事情我就拜托纱纱了……」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0290", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，现在给小爱换下衣服吧？\\n　然后再给她擦擦身体」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "「嗯，现在给小爱换下衣服吧？　然后再给她擦擦身体」", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0291", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我马上准备」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0632", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，总之先换衣服吧……」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在樱乃眼神的催促下，\\n我打开了衣柜取出了替换的衣物。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "在樱乃眼神的催促下，我打开了衣柜取出了替换的衣物。", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这件可以吗？嗯」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我递出一整件衣服，大家的脸都唰的一下红了。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？怎么了，不行吗？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我的意思是你先出去避一下」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0633", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是啊，或许也只有瓜生才会知道替换的衣服的位置呢」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「是、是啊，或许也只有瓜生才会知道替换的衣服的位置呢」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0292", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说来这里就连\\n　新吾同学的衣服都有啊。\\n　哈哈，感觉不经意间还挺刺激的……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「这么说来这里就连　新吾同学的衣服都有啊。　哈哈，感觉不经意间还挺刺激的……」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊～」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我后知后觉，脸也发烫起来。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我和爱理是“那种”关系了，\\n已经是不可否认的事实。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": "不过，我和爱理是“那种”关系了，已经是不可否认的事实。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总、总之，先帮她换衣服吧」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是啊。\\n　要是男朋友帮她换的话，小爱或许会更安心吧」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "「嗯，是啊。　要是男朋友帮她换的话，小爱或许会更安心吧」", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0293", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……学姐你能这么说就帮大忙了」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了小爱，身子起来一下～」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0294", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜……呜呜……不行……我不会，我不会啊……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3072", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这种……呜，呜，结果，不要……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3073", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家脸上都挂满了担忧。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……爱理在梦里都还在考试，\\n一直被“不行，不会”的梦魇缠绕着。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "……爱理在梦里都还在考试，一直被“不行，不会”的梦魇缠绕着。", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
